    <string name="howto_text">1. Everyone joins the same Wi-Fi or one phone\'s hotspot.\n2. One player taps \"Create room\"; the others tap \"Join room\" and pick the room (or type the host IP).\n3. Everyone places ships of length 5, 4, 3, 3 and 2 on the 10x10 grid.\n4. In turn, pick a cell on an opponent\'s grid and tap \"Fire!\". A hit gives you another shot.\n5. A ship sinks when all its cells are hit. A player with no ships left is out.\n6. The last player standing wins. If you do not fire within 30 seconds, a random cell is fired for you.</string>
